" alt=\"JEE Main 2020 (Online) 8th January Morning Slot Chemistry - Solutions Question 141 English\">\nThe following inferences are made :\n<br>(A) X has higher intermolecular interactions compared to Y.\n<br>(B) X has lower intermolecular interactions compared to Y.\n<br>(C) Z has lower intermolecular interactions compared to Y.\n<br>The correct inference (s) is / are :","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"(B)"},{"identifier":"B","content":"(A)"},{"identifier":"C","content":"(C)"},{"identifier":"D","content":"(A) and (C)"}],"correct_options":["A"],"answer":null,"explanation":"Vapour pressure of a liquid at a given\ntemperature is inversely proportional to\nintermolecular force of attraction. At the same\ntemperature, vapour pressure of X is higher\nthan that of Y.\n<br><br>Therefore (X) has lower intermolecular\ninteractions compared to Y. Statement (B) is\ncorrect."},"hi":{"content":"तीन विभिन्न द्रवों X, Y, और Z के लिए वाष्प दाब और तापमान का एक ग्राफ नीचे दिखाया गया है :<br><img src=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/7k9k2k5h1371i/cc67ea86-3980-4646-81f2-5781c5ffc10b/7e3f8060-3888-11ea-92dd-4b9c3519996f/file-7k9k2k5h1371j-320w.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;height: auto;display: block;margin: 0 auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"JEE Main 2020 (Online) 8th January Morning Slot Chemistry - Solutions Question 141 Hindi\">\nनिम्नलिखित निष्कर्ष बनाए गए हैं :\n<br>(A) X में Y की तुलना में अधिक अंतराणु आकर्षण है।\n<br>(B) X में Y की तुलना में कम अंतराणु आकर्षण है।\n<br>(C) Z में Y की तुलना में कम अंतराणु आकर्षण है।\n<br>सही निष्कर्ष क्या है / हैं :","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"(B)"},{"identifier":"B","content":"(A)"},{"identifier":"C","content":"(C)"},{"identifier":"D","content":"(A) और (C)"}],"correct_options":["A"],"answer":null,"explanation":null,"comprehension":null,"direction":null}},"question_id":"e75DUB2jBZE6rrFwjx7k9k2k5h15kp6","updated_time":1581048017,"permalink":"a-graph-of-vapour-pressure-and-temperature-for-three-differe-jee-main-chemistry-thermod